# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Mirrors .gitignore, plus things an image never needs.
.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.turbo
.vscode
.idea

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Secrets must never reach a build context, layer or image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.aws
**/secrets
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars

.data
tmp
docs
**/*.md
# What the image carries of the repository itself: its overview and its notices (deploy/Dockerfile).
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!TRADEMARKS.md
# The documentation the web UI renders into its pages at build time (docs/nav.json names the files).
!docs/nav.json
!docs/guide/*.md
!docs/specs/*.md
!deploy/README.md
